        does: T("Guarda kind (CLASS, ATTRIBUTE, RELATION, OBJECT, MODEL, REPRESENTATION, SELECTION, PROJECT), classId y featureId; normaliza los vacíos a cadena vacía y valida el formato de identificador solo cuando vienen informados.", "Holds kind (CLASS, ATTRIBUTE, RELATION, OBJECT, MODEL, REPRESENTATION, SELECTION, PROJECT), classId and featureId; normalises empties to blank strings and validates identifier format only when present."),
